  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你是超Z队的人啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F8D85005A961F76844EBA554A3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锈蚀组都在议论，\n说你实力很强。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "950886807EC490FD57288BAE8BBAFF0C000A8BF44F605B9E529B5F885F3A3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你有兴趣了，\n就跟我打一场吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F60670951748DA34E86FF0C000A5C318DDF621162534E00573A54273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z队的人，\n想对战了就来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A961F76844EBAFF0C000A60F35BF962184E865C316765627E621154273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你很有干劲啊～\n我们这就开打吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605F8867095E7252B2554AFF5E000A62114EEC8FD95C315F0062535427FF1F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开打！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F006253FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "钢属性有多硬，\n我的信念～就有多硬！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94A25C5E60276709591A786CFF0C000A621176844FE15FF5FF5E5C316709591A786CFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "搞什么嘛，都来找我了，\n就跟我打一场啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "641E4EC04E48561BFF0C90FD6765627E62114E86FF0C000A5C318DDF621162534E00573A554A3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，\n你这个人还挺好相处呢～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C000A4F608FD94E2A4EBA8FD8633A597D76F859045462FF5E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然输了也没办法～\n给你讲一个我压箱底的故事吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E271368F934E864E5F6CA1529E6CD5FF5E000A7ED94F608BB24E004E2A6211538B7BB15E95768465454E8B54273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "钢不会被毒侵袭！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94A24E0D4F1A88AB6BD24FB588ADFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说，年轻时的吉普索先生\n喜欢上了更加年轻的乌羽先生。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF4FF0C5E748F7B65F676845409666E7D225148751F000A559C6B224E0A4E8666F452A05E748F7B76844E4C7FBD5148751F3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但乌羽先生是用毒的啊！\n虽然这毒能迷惑对手，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但也可能会侵袭乌羽先生本人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464E4C7FBD5148751F662F75286BD27684554AFF01000A867D71368FD96BD280FD8FF760D15BF9624BFF0C00100001BE00000A4F464E5F53EF80FD4F1A4FB588AD4E4C7FBD5148751F672C4EBA3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是啊，吉普索先生\n每次看到盔甲鸟们，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n都会振作精神，\n以防被毒过分迷惑。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F554AFF0C5409666E7D225148751F000A6BCF6B21770B523076D475329E1F4EECFF0C00100001BE01000A90FD4F1A632F4F5C7CBE795EFF0C000A4EE5963288AB6BD28FC752068FF760D13002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然很无聊，但是个不错的故事。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n公司的二把手都这么用心，\n我们下面的人也就放心啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71365F8865E0804AFF0C4F46662F4E2A4E0D9519768465454E8B300200100001BE01000A516C53F876844E8C628A624B90FD8FD94E4875285FC3FF0C000A62114EEC4E0B976276844EBA4E5F5C31653E5FC355663002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了感谢你和我动真格地对战，\n以及听我讲了无聊的故事，这个送你了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86611F8C224F60548C621152A8771F683C57305BF96218FF0C000A4EE553CA542C62118BB24E8665E0804A768465454E8BFF0C8FD94E2A90014F604E863002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后也请多多关照咯，\n乌羽先生的跟班，超Z队！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA540E4E5F8BF7591A591A5173716754AFFF0C000A4E4C7FBD5148751F76848DDF73EDFF0C8D85005A961FFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后也请多多关照咯，\n乌羽先生的跟班，超Z队！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
